# Repository Instructions

This file is a public template for local operator guidance. Copy it to
`AGENTS.md` in your clone and customize that local file for your own host,
deployment path, process manager, and operational rules.

`AGENTS.md` is intentionally ignored so clone-specific instructions do not
normally appear in `git diff`.

## Local Deployment Notes

- Set secrets and environment-specific values in `.env`.
- Keep `.env`, runtime databases, lock files, and local deployment overlays out
  of commits and published artifacts.
- If you use systemd, copy
  `deploy/systemd/team-dinner-bot.service.example` to
  `deploy/systemd/team-dinner-bot.service`, customize it locally, then install
  it according to your operating system practices.
- Avoid running more than one Socket Mode worker for the same Slack app at the
  same time.

## Suggested Local Commands

```powershell
copy config.example.env .env
copy AGENTS.md.example AGENTS.md
copy deploy\systemd\team-dinner-bot.service.example deploy\systemd\team-dinner-bot.service
```
